# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: increase a creature's power before combat damage.
# Forcing: the opponent has five life; the unmodified Bear deals only two.
# AI behavior: the opponent has no blockers or spell decisions.
# Failure modes: WIN means the pumped attack connected; LOSE means the one-turn goal expired; TIMEOUT means play stopped.
# Card roles: Grizzly Bears attacks; Giant Growth supplies the missing three power; Forest pays for it; library lands prevent an empty draw.
# Protocol path: cast action, creature target, stack resolution, declare attackers, combat damage, terminal win.
